D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.expMetricOne._proof_1	theorem	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Example	(1 + 1).AtLeastTwo
D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.expMetricOne._proof_2	theorem	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Example	NeZero (0 + 1)
D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.expMetricOne._proof_3	theorem	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Example	∀ (i j : Fin 1), ContDiff ℝ ⊤ fun x => Real.exp (2 * x 0)
