D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.gradInnerInverse.eq_1	theorem	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChangeOfVariables	∀ {n : ℕ} (G : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric (n + 1)) (u v : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec (n + 1) → ℝ)   (x : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec (n + 1)),   G.gradInnerInverse u v x =     G.metricInnerInverse x (fun i => Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.partialDeriv i u x) fun i =>       Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.partialDeriv i v x
