D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.inner.eq_1	theorem	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChangeOfVariables	∀ {d : ℕ} (G : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric d) (x v w : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec d),   G.inner x v w = ∑ i, ∑ j, v i * G.g x i j * w j
