D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.laplacian.eq_1	theorem	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.IBP	∀ {n : ℕ} (G : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric (n + 1)) (u : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec (n + 1) → ℝ)   (x : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec (n + 1)), G.laplacian u x = G.divergence (G.grad u) x
