D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.pullbackDensity_eq	theorem	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChangeOfVariables	∀ {d : ℕ} (G : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric d) (H : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartDiffeomorphism d)   (x : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec d), (G.pullbackMetric H).density x = G.density (H.ψ x) * |(fderiv ℝ H.ψ x).det|
