D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.pullbackMatrix.eq_1	theorem	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChangeOfVariables	∀ {d : ℕ} (G : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric d) (ψ : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec d → Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec d)   (x : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec d),   G.pullbackMatrix ψ x =     (Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.jacobianMatrix ψ x).transpose * G.matrix (ψ x) *       Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.jacobianMatrix ψ x
