D13TYPE	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric.pullbackMetric._proof_2	theorem	Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChangeOfVariables	∀ {d : ℕ} (G : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartMetric d) (H : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.ChartDiffeomorphism d)   (x : Poincare.D12.VolumeIBP.Vec d),   (Matrix.of fun i j => G.pullbackMatrix H.ψ x i j).IsHermitian ∧     ∀ ⦃x_1 : Fin d →₀ ℝ⦄,       x_1 ≠ 0 →         0 < x_1.sum fun i xi => x_1.sum fun j xj => star xi * Matrix.of (fun i j => G.pullbackMatrix H.ψ x i j) i j * xj
