  (self : Longrun.PDE.ContinuousHeatHypotheses u a b T) : ContinuousOn (fun p => u p.1 p.2) (Icc a b ×ˢ Icc 0 T)
info: Poincare/D7/Limit/Probe.lean:30:0: Poincare.Longrun.PDE.ContinuousHeatHypotheses.heat_equation {u : ℝ → ℝ → ℝ} {a b T : ℝ}
