info: Poincare/D7/Limit/Probe.lean:37:0: @Longrun.PDE.HeatGridEvolution.step_eq_convex : ∀ {N : ℕ} {α : ℝ} (ev : Longrun.PDE.HeatGridEvolution N α) {t i : ℕ},
